\url{https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2013/hash/eae27d77ca20db309e056e3d2dcd7d69-Abstract.html}. Read primary 2013 abstract describing density estimation from local link counts and integration along graph paths; full assumptions and proof not independently verified here.

